{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_15_level_main_15-10_beg","groupId":"main_15","stageId":"main_15-10","title":"一段長夢將醒","storyCode":"15-11","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_15-10_beg.txt","sourceHash":"e7c3a4b4b8af152b09789ac37782de0ef3c6f9b34772769cdf3155350d0f0e71","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert03_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"弗里斯頓不明白為什麼女兒要約自己在這裡見面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡可不算度假的好去處，鞋子裡太容易進沙子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，休息一下吧。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他坐在沙丘上，脫下皮鞋。而傾倒下來的沙塵卻隨風撲向了他的臉，弄得他狼狽不堪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，咳咳……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這也太不體面了——禮服？我為什麼要穿全套的禮服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她為什麼約我來這裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"通訊沒有任何回應，他只能在黃沙中茫然地踱步，他呼喚著女兒的名字。\n無人回應他，直到夜色來臨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert03_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……派對？"},{"type":"narration","text":"他循著聲音找了過去，看到了遠處沙丘上張燈結綵的營地。\n他聽到了女兒熟悉的笑聲，他欣喜若狂地狂奔而去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“女兒”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你還是趕來了我的婚禮，爸爸！"},{"type":"narration","text":"那頭金髮讓弗里斯頓幾乎要哭出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我找了你很久，我的晨光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是你的婚禮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“女兒”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當然，典禮快開始了，我們過去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“女兒”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們會挽著手走過紅毯。祝福我吧，爸爸。"},{"type":"narration","text":"弗里斯頓想要牽住她的手，卻怎麼也碰不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“女兒”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……你不想祝福我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不……不……不是這樣……我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g8_storage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）……我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"失落的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……你不想祝福我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）……我的晨光？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克麗斯騰","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也並不期許我們看到那片真實的星空？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）……你不是我的晨光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）我已經離開了家？這個地下掩體，我記得——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）“保存間”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克麗斯騰","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你不再回應我的請教了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）克麗斯騰。你是克麗斯騰……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）我聽說過你，不不，我見過你……不對，我是從哪裡知道了你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）我從沒認識過你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）哪個混蛋關上了我的燈？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）該死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗里斯頓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼要把我關在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這又是某種無聊的惡作劇嗎？可露希爾！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesbedroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"弗里斯頓發現自己被滿房間的“照片”完全淹沒了，而一本《泰拉全物種詳考》的書冊正蓋在他的鏡頭模組上。\n或許也算不上照片……他從未去過照片中的任何地方，也無法去到照片裡的任何地方。\n大量的照片上只印刷著零碎的影像。\n沙丘、篝火、營地、金色的頭髮，還有那間暗無天日的保存間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……夢？"},{"type":"narration","text":"弗里斯頓做了一個夢。Friston-3做了一個夢。\n而他更是列印了自己的夢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我不該有做夢的功能才對，是可露希爾偷偷上傳了新的韌體嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesengineeringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弗里斯頓先生，我現在沒有時間和你爭論！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以非常明確地向你保證，我絕對絕對沒有給你上傳任何能讓你做夢的韌體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"PRTS的異常越來越嚴重，備用指揮系統上線也還需要時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……還要手動分配工作內容，我現在眼睛已經快看不過來了！而且某些區域已經完全失去了聯絡，情況完全不明——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放輕鬆，可露希爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不是想要和你爭論，只不過是在嘗試排除引發我身體出現罕見故障的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們既然已經排除了韌體錯誤和硬體故障的可能性，那——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾，回答我一個很重要的問題……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"驅動我核心運轉的能源是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，當然是源石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的改型作業平台幾乎都是源石驅動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……弗里斯頓先生，你的語氣很可怕。你想說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾，你是一個天才。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能想到提前切斷所有改型作業平台與PRTS的連接，但恐怕這遠遠不夠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？怎麼了？為什麼突然開始顛簸了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"泡普卡是被不斷閃爍的亮光弄醒的。她看向舷窗外，卻並沒有發現任何異樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……今天的天氣很好，好像沒有要下雨的樣子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是其他人在外面訓練弄出來的動靜嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦……PRTS的通訊還是沒有恢復嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，今天好像是去艦外隔離帶出外勤的日子，先去找梓蘭姐姐報到吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesupperdeck"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈囉~大家，都去哪裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好安靜啊……梓蘭姐姐現在在哪裡呢？嗯，聯絡不到……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先去餐廳看看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"餐廳、餐廳是在這邊——"},{"type":"narration","text":"睡眼朦朧的泡普卡閉著眼睛也知道從甲板走到餐廳的路線。\n她太熟悉羅德島了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，欸，啊啊啊啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好痛……泡普卡，好痛……"},{"type":"narration","text":"她發現自己被隨意丟在走廊上的工程部箱子絆倒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像……工程部最近確實在做很多改造，不過這片區域好像早就結束了啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，太粗心啦！"},{"type":"narration","text":"她蹲下揉了揉已經不怎麼有痛感的膝蓋，然後順手將散落在地上的工具和箱子收到了走廊邊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，又是那個光……到底……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她站起身，下意識地看向了一旁的舷窗——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"泡普卡看到了許多奇怪模樣的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們，是誰……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是新來的客人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"泡普卡記得，舷窗的那一邊好像是甲板，她們是迷路了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她快速地在走廊中前進，但越走卻越疑惑，於是她漸漸慢了下來……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼，每一扇舷窗上都能看到她們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梓、梓蘭姐姐，這裡是泡普卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通訊系統好像還是有異常，我不知道你那邊現在能不能收到……泡普卡的訊息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有發現一些奇怪的事情嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"通訊中依舊沒有傳回梓蘭的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舷窗外的模糊聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）當真正的毀滅……面前……無能為力……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"舷窗外的模糊聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）……平等的結局……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，她們，在說話嗎？聽不清楚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯，還是先執行任務比較重要，梓蘭姐姐她們是不是已經在艦外隔離帶等泡普卡了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesupperdeck"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……先左轉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再直走，然後推開門……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後就是離艦通道——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先下降到地面……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像到了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"narration","text":"泡普卡回頭看向自己剛剛走出來的離艦通道，卻發現它已經消失不見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"泡普卡，我們正找你，大家都到齊了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"……你遇到什麼事了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梓、梓蘭姐姐，離艦通道……是在這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓蘭","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"離艦通道？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——滋……所有能夠收到通訊……幹員注意……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不要相信……滋……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通訊受阻……滋……羅德島……醒了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——警告……滋……再次——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泡普卡","speakerId":"avg_281_popka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……可露希爾小姐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescorner"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（迷茫地前進）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的“小嘟嘟”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（敵視的架勢）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉了，小傢伙。可不能再讓你傷到其他人了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的“小嘟嘟”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（生氣地轉圈）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼你會突然攻擊我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然暫時弄不清楚，不過本艦應該發生什麼怪事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這小傢伙突然失蹤了一段時間，再回來的時候就變成這樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，本艦的構造好像在持續發生變化，我都快迷路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種感覺太奇怪了。就像是……就像是這艘船——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活過來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"敵襲警報？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這怎麼可能……我們明明已經在羅德島周圍設立了隔離帶。如果有敵人來襲的話，我們一定會提前收到警告才對。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"除非……敵人是來自內部。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不確定……我們在總指揮室，現在這裡卻觀測不到羅德島上任何一處的狀態！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"向凱爾希醫生和其他精英幹員發出的訊息，也沒有得到任何回覆……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們去找他們。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"先把大家聚集在一起，再想辦法解決。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我來負責保護博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"源石結晶體","speakerId":"avg_npc_1727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉默地靠近）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1727_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是——？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_278_orchid","aliases":["梓蘭"]}]}
